SHEET: 16:9 landscape, flat dark warm grey backdrop (#2B2825), no environment, soft top-left light, clear form shading. Title at the top: "BR BRINECALLER — CRUST, BRINE, STEEPED". Three rows, each with a short row head at the far left.

THE STORY: her Tide skills leave pools of BRINE (murky teal sea-water with foam); her Salt skills leave salt CRUST (grey-green, gritty, crooked sea-salt). An enemy on crust gains ENCRUSTED stacks, one per second; at five it is CRYSTALLIZED for 2 seconds. Lye skills add CORRODED stacks. She deals more damage to enemies standing in brine or crust: she is STEEPED. Her salt is never pure white or symmetrical.

